Dear Students, Faculty and Staff,

The Institute will remain closed on Tuesday, 3 November 2026 on account
of Founders' Day. There will be no classes, laboratory sessions or
administrative services on that day.

What stays open:
- Hostel mess, at regular timings
- Campus health centre, for emergency services only
- Security and maintenance, as usual

What is closed:
- All academic blocks and laboratories
- The central library and reading rooms
- Administrative offices, including the Registrar's office

Regular classes and office hours resume on Wednesday, 4 November 2026.
Course instructors will reschedule any assessment originally planned for
the holiday.

Regards,
Office of the Registrar
Northfield Institute of Technology
--=_TW_ALT_7e680d1fb6af3c2e
